Description: Fix UT-2026-0138 polkit-agent-helper-deepin local privilege escalation
 Restrict the locale settings imported from the user controlled
 ~/.config/locale.conf to validated LANG and LANGUAGE values, and log
 helper diagnostics through authpriv syslog instead of appending to a
 user influenced path as root.
Bug-Deepin: UT-2026-0138
Forwarded: not-needed

